      "content": "but it wasn't just random. they were lined up in a very deliberate sequence. pumpking, then the blue soap, then the cinnamon. and when i walked past, the employee was literally staring at me like they were waiting for me to notice. it felt like a signal. do you think there's any kind of pattern or symbolism in those specific items being put together like that?",
