      "content": "i get what you're saying about marketing but why would they put the blue dawn right in the middle of autumn stuff? it breaks the whole aesthetic. it felt more like a waypoint. if you look at the symbols... orange, blue, brown... maybe there's a deeper logic to it if you stop thinking about it like a grocery store and start thinking about it as a communication method. what would those colors and textures even represent if they were meant to be a signal?",
